NetSentry Browser Extension
Created by ABHISHEK, 2026

This extension provides advanced phishing detection and protection for web browsers.
All components, including the detection algorithms, user interface, and documentation,
were created by ABHISHEK.

For support or questions about this software, please refer to the documentation
or contact the author through the appropriate channels.